Changes:
- Language hooks moved from Language.Language to TeamCherry.Localization.Language
  (the game moved its Language class in 1.5.12620).
- Benchwarp.csproj: reference TeamCherry.Localization.dll,
  MMHOOK_TeamCherry.Localization.dll and the game's netstandard.dll, and compile
  against the game's own mscorlib (FrameworkPathOverride).

